          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Seiya! Soiya!"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, mental, sonic)\n\nThe night parade shouts a series of energetic call-and-responses, dealing 3d10 sonic damage and 4d6 mental damage to all creatures in a 10-foot burst within 20 feet (41 basic Will save). If the troop is reduced to 8 or fewer squares, this area decreases to a 5-foot burst."
            },
